{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. If object seen, approach it. Then take object and check its properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = RetrieveObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
